{"type":"thought","data":" PTE yields exactly "}
{"type":"thought","data":"8 GiB of traffic. At"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 10 GiB/s this takes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" about 0.8 seconds.\n\n"}
{"type":"thought","data":"I will verify the inode"}
{"type":"thought","data":" example with Python"}
{"type":"thought","data":" before writing it down.\n\nI am also preparing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a block-device example"}
{"type":"thought","data":" using file offset 100000"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and block size 4096."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFor a file offset "}
{"type":"thought","data":"of 100000 and a block"}
{"type":"thought","data":" size of 4096, the block"}
{"type":"thought","data":" index is 24 and the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" byte offset within "}
{"type":"thought","data":"that block is 1696. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"Because ext4 uses 12"}
{"type":"thought","data":" direct pointers, block"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 24 falls into the single"}
{"type":"thought","data":" indirect region. A "}
{"type":"thought","data":"cold cache therefore"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires two disk reads"}
{"type":"thought","data":" after the inode is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"already in memory: one"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for the indirect block"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and one for the data"}
{"type":"thought","data":" block. If the inode"}
{"type":"thought","data":" itself is not cached,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a third read is needed.\n\nI will describe the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ext4 block-group layout"}
{"type":"thought","data":" without claiming specific"}
{"type":"thought","data":" byte offsets. The standard"}
{"type":"thought","data":" order is superblock,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" group descriptors, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"reserved GDT, block "}
{"type":"thought","data":"bitmap, inode bitmap,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inode table, and data"}
{"type":"thought","data":" blocks. I will cite"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the kernel documentation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for this structure."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI am verifying documentation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" URLs with curl and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"checking man7 pages."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I have identified the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" kernel.org references"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for virtio, eBPF, AF_XDP,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and network scaling"}
{"type":"thought","data":" features such as RSS,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" RPS, RFS, XPS, and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"GRO."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI am checking whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the io_uring man page"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exists on man7.org "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and will curl a batch"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of documentation URLs."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I plan to review L05c,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" L07c, and L03c for "}
{"type":"thought","data":"link references and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"adopt R01’s practice"}
{"type":"thought","data":" link style. I will "}
{"type":"thought","data":"fold question callouts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and add aliases for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" SMP, NUMA, inode, block"}
{"type":"thought","data":" device, and sk_buff."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will format frontmatter"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sources as a YAML list,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" matching R01. I am "}
{"type":"thought","data":"checking that dashes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are written correctly."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Each concept section"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must exceed 250 characters"}
{"type":"thought","data":" after HTML comments"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are stripped; the coverage"}
{"type":"thought","data":" comment sits inside"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the section and is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"removed before the length"}
{"type":"thought","data":" check. The checker "}
{"type":"thought","data":"flags status and seed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" separately. I will "}
{"type":"thought","data":"not include lab or practice"}
{"type":"thought","data":" problems in this lesson."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will verify URLs"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and compute numbers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" before writing the file. I am checking L03c, L05c, and L07c for accurate link targets. I will cite R01’s virtual-memory section for cache details. No networking papers are needed for this lesson."}
