,112,32,100,105,118,101,115,10,52,57,57,58,35,35,32,77,111,100,101,114,110,32,100,101,115,99,101,110,100,97,110,116,115,10,53,49,52,58,35,35,32,80,105,116,102,97,108,108,115,32,97,110,100,32,101,120,97,109,32,116,114,97,112,115,10,53,52,54,58,35,35,32,80,114,97,99,116,105,99,101,10,53,53,48,58,35,35,32,76,97,98,10,53,53,52,58,35,35,32,70,117,114,116,104,101,114,32,114,101,97,100,105,110,103,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],"stderr":[],"exit_code":0,"match_count":12,"file_matches":[{"path":"/Users/shreejitverma/.treehouse/SDE-Interview-Prep-3215ec/3/SDE-Interview-Prep/01-CS-Foundations/Operating-Systems/AOS/Part-5-Internet-Scale-Real-Time-and-Security/L09a-Giant-Scale-Services.md","matches":[{"line_number":27,"content":"## Learning outcomes"},{"line_number":36,"content":"## Motivation and the problem"},{"line_number":47,"content":"## Core concepts"},{"line_number":377,"content":"## Mechanisms step by step"},{"line_number":410,"content":"## Worked examples"},{"line_number":461,"content":"## Comparison"},{"line_number":476,"content":"## Paper deep dives"},{"line_number":499,"content":"## Modern descendants"},{"line_number":514,"content":"## Pitfalls and exam traps"},{"line_number":546,"content":"## Practice"},{"line_number":550,"content":"## Lab"},{"line_number":554,"content":"## Further reading"}]}]},"locations":[]}
{"type":"thought","data":"The virtio and SR-IOV"}
{"type":"thought","data":" heading is being converted"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to a slug."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe L09 Dynamo paper"}
{"type":"thought","data":" link is set. L07c will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be linked despite its"}
{"type":"thought","data":" seed-like status. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" full note will follow"}
{"type":"thought","data":" strict formatting rules:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one sentence per line,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ASCII punctuation only,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" no emojis or em dashes,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and all headings and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" coverage comments kept"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verbatim."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nR01 table cells and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" learning outcomes will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" each be one sentence."}
{"type":"thought","data":" ASCII art will be fenced."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The \"why\" for SMP versus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" NUMA is being drafted."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nSMP is defined as "}
{"type":"thought","data":"symmetric execution "}
{"type":"thought","data":"with uniform latency"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and a single snooping"}
{"type":"thought","data":" interconnect. NUMA "}
{"type":"thought","data":"is defined as local "}
{"type":"thought","data":"versus remote memory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" access, with ccNUMA"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still sharing one coherence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" domain; the OS problem"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is placement rather"}
{"type":"thought","data":" than coherence. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" move to NUMA was driven"}
{"type":"thought","data":" by single-controller"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pin limits and bus "}
{"type":"thought","data":"bandwidth saturation."}
{"type":"thought","data":" A table and ASCII diagram"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will illustrate these"}
{"type":"thought","data":" concepts. Locks, schedulers,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and page placement "}
{"type":"thought","data":"all assume distance."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA test-and-set that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" was a single bus transaction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on SMP becomes a remote"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cache-line bounce on"}
{"type":"thought","data":" NUMA.\n\nAn inode is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the file's metadata "}
{"type":"thought","data":"object, named by a number"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than a path."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Separating names from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inodes supports hard"}
{"type":"thought","data":" links, unlink while"}
{"type":"thought","data":" open, and rename. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" structures table covers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" superblock, inode, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"directory entry, data"}
{"type":"thought","data":" block, indirect block,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and bitmap. An ASCII"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pointer tree will illustrate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the classic layout."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Indirect blocks exist"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because fixed-size inodes cannot hold pointers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for every block of "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a large file.\n\nIndirect blocks add"}
{"type":"thought","data":" extra I/Os at the leaves,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which is why extents"}
{"type":"thought","data":" became popular.\n\nThe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" VFS inode is an in-memory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cached object, while"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the on-disk inode is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the persistent record."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The filesystem implements"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this cached object."}
{"type":"thought","data":" A block device is an"}
{"type":"thought","data":" addressable array of"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixed-size sectors,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and a filesystem interprets"}
{"type":"thought","data":" those sectors."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe block layer unifies"}
{"type":"thought","data":" many devices—disks,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" SSDs, partitions, LVM,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" loop, and virtio-blk—so"}
{"type":"thought","data":" filesystems do not "}
{"type":"thought","data":"need to know the underlying storage type.\n\nA buffered"}
{"type":"thought","data":" write flows from dirty"}
{"type":"thought","data":" page cache through "}
{"type":"thought","data":"writeback, offset mapping"}
{"type":"thought","data":" via the inode, a bio,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" blk-mq, and finally"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the driver.\n\nBlock "}
{"type":"thought","data":"devices are contrasted"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with character devices"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because they support"}
{"type":"thought","data":" seekable block addresses."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Flash FTL typically"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exposes a block interface,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while raw MTD is an"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exception."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nO_DIRECT and raw device"}
{"type":"thought","data":" opens let databases"}
{"type":"thought","data":" bypass the page cache"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and manage their own"}
{"type":"thought","data":" buffers, though the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" underlying storage "}
{"type":"thought","data":"remains a block device."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Device sectors are "}
{"type":"thought","data":"512 or 4096 bytes; filesystem"}
{"type":"thought","data":" blocks are multiples"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of that size, so I/O"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is issued in sectors"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at the bottom and blocks"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at the top. The next"}
{"type":"thought","data":" section will cover "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the Linux network protocol"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stack layers."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe network stack "}
{"type":"thought","data":"is defined as the sequence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of kernel layers that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" convert a socket call"}
{"type":"thought","data":" into a link-layer frame"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and back. A table will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" list each layer with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" its job, header, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" failure mode. IP addresses"}
{"type":"thought","data":" identify hosts while"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ports identify endpoints"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on those hosts; the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" demux key is protocol"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plus local address "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and port, and for TCP"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it also includes the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" remote pair. Layering"}
{"type":"thought","data":" allows replacing one"}
{"type":"thought","data":" layer without touching"}
{"type":"thought","data":" another, such as swapping"}
{"type":"thought","data":" TCP for UDP or Ethernet"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for virtio-net. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cost is headers, per-layer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cache misses, and sk_buff"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pointer chasing.\n\nsk_buff is a single"}
{"type":"thought","data":" packet representation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with headroom for prepending"}
{"type":"thought","data":" headers by pointer "}
{"type":"thought","data":"adjustment. The Linux"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stack omits the OSI"}
{"type":"thought","data":" session and presentation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" layers; applications"}
{"type":"thought","data":" handle those responsibilities."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe data path from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" application to NIC "}
{"type":"thought","data":"will be split between"}
{"type":"thought","data":" concept and mechanisms."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The concept section"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will explain TX and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" RX asymmetry and provide"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a condensed overview,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while the full step-by-step"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sequence belongs in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mechanisms."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nTX and RX are asymmetric."}
{"type":"thought","data":" TX copies data into"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the socket buffer, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"segments at TCP, routes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and resolves neighbors,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" enqueues to a qdisc,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" DMA's it, and completes."}
{"type":"thought","data":" RX DMA's the frame,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" triggers an interrupt,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" processes it via NAPI"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and GRO, runs IP and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" TCP, queues to the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"socket, copies out, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and wakes the process."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nCopies exist because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" user and kernel do not share pages by default"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for protection, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" DMA requires physical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pages that will not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" move. Zero-copy is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"an exception via sendfile"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and MSG_ZEROCOPY with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" its own lifetime rules."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe mechanisms section"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will include a namei"}
{"type":"thought","data":" flowchart, a send()"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sequence diagram, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at least one mermaid.\n\nA sequence diagram"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will illustrate the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" transmit path, and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a flowchart will trace"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pathname resolution."}
{"type":"thought","data":" A worked example will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" compute how many pages"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a 100000-byte write"}
{"type":"thought","data":" dirties on a 4 KiB "}
{"type":"thought","data":"page boundary."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe 100000-byte write"}
{"type":"thought","data":" example will bridge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" concepts by showing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that 25 page-cache "}
{"type":"thought","data":"pages map to 25 data"}
{"type":"thought","data":" blocks, one indirect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" block, and the inode."}
{"type":"thought","data":" A comparison table "}
{"type":"thought","data":"is being drafted to "}
{"type":"thought","data":"contrast SMP versus "}
{"type":"thought","data":"NUMA versus single socket,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" classic indirect versus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" extents, buffered I/O"}
{"type":"thought","data":" versus O_DIRECT versus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" raw block device, interrupt-per-packet"}
{"type":"thought","data":" versus NAPI versus "}
{"type":"thought","data":"XDP, TCP versus UDP,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and send copy versus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sendfile. Paper deep"}
