{"type":"thought","data":" not the filename. A"}
{"type":"thought","data":" directory entry is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the name. Link count"}
{"type":"thought","data":" differs from an open"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file.\n\nA block device"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is not a file. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"filesystem is not the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" disk. Sector size is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not the filesystem "}
{"type":"thought","data":"block size.\n\nWriting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a byte may not trigger"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one disk I/O because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of page caching. O_SYNC"}
{"type":"thought","data":" changes that.\n\nPorts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are 16-bit transport-layer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" identifiers, not IP"}
{"type":"thought","data":" addresses. NAT rewrites"}
{"type":"thought","data":" them.\n\nThe OSI session"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and presentation layers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are not Linux layers.\n\nDMA completion does"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not mean the peer received"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the bytes. One interrupt"}
{"type":"thought","data":" per packet cannot survive"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 10 Gb/s and above. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"Remote NUMA access remains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" coherent on a ccNUMA"}
{"type":"thought","data":" machine; it is slow,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not stale. The first"}
{"type":"thought","data":" thread to write a page"}
{"type":"thought","data":" often places it incorrectly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" when initialization"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and compute differ."}
{"type":"thought","data":" A hard link points "}
{"type":"thought","data":"to an inode directly,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while a symlink is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"another inode. The note"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will include a folded"}
{"type":"thought","data":" arithmetic practice question and link to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Practice-R.\n\nThe note will include"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one or two folded retrieval"}
{"type":"thought","data":" questions based on "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the worked example, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"following R01’s pattern."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The existing lab link"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be kept with a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" brief sentence. Further"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reading will cite only"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verified URLs."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nBach’s Design of the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" UNIX Operating System,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Stevens’ TCP/IP Illustrated,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and Bovet/Cesati or"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Love for Linux kernel"}
{"type":"thought","data":" concepts will be cited"}
{"type":"thought","data":" without URLs. Page "}
{"type":"thought","data":"numbers will not be "}
{"type":"thought","data":"claimed. Kernel documentation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is preferred."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will run a Python"}
{"type":"thought","data":" check for non-ASCII"}
{"type":"thought","data":" characters, em dashes,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" seed markers, and sentence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" formatting before writing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the file. Each sentence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must be on its own "}
{"type":"thought","data":"physical line; long "}
{"type":"thought","data":"lines are acceptable."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Callout continuation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lines start with `>`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Blank lines separate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" paragraphs. Semicolons"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are allowed within "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a single sentence."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nPeriods and newlines"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be used to keep"}
{"type":"thought","data":" each sentence on its"}
{"type":"thought","data":" own physical line. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"Exclamation marks are"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omitted.\n\nFrontmatter"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will follow R01’s list"}
{"type":"thought","data":" format for sources."}
{"type":"thought","data":" All required keys will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be present, including"}
{"type":"thought","data":" type, track, level,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" status, last_reviewed,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" course, part, sub_lesson,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lab, papers, tags, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and aliases.\n\nThe status"}
{"type":"thought","data":" key will be set to "}
{"type":"thought","data":"solid. The last_reviewed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" key will remain empty"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to match the stub’s"}
{"type":"thought","data":" existing empty value."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe level key will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be left empty. Aliases"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will include SMP, NUMA,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ccNUMA, inode, and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"block device. qspinlock"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is excluded. The 5 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"MiB inode example will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" show explicit arithmetic:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 4096-byte blocks, 1024"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pointers per indirect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" block, 1280 data blocks,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 12 direct pointers,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and 1024 single-indirect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" blocks."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe 5 MiB file requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" three indirect blocks:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one single-indirect,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one double-indirect,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and one child block"}
{"type":"thought","data":" under the double. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inode table is excluded"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from the block count."}
{"type":"thought","data":" A cold read of the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"final byte triggers "}
{"type":"thought","data":"four disk reads; three"}
{"type":"thought","data":" if the inode is already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cached."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe 5 MiB file’s final"}
{"type":"thought","data":" byte sits in block "}
{"type":"thought","data":"index 1279, which falls"}
{"type":"thought","data":" under the double-indirect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" region. Its child block"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is index 243 and its"}
{"type":"thought","data":" slot within that child"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is 243. A 100000-byte"}
{"type":"thought","data":" offset maps to block"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 24, which is the twelfth"}
{"type":"thought","data":" single-indirect slot;"}
{"type":"thought","data":" after the inode is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"cached, only two disk"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reads are needed for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a cold read at that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" offset. The NUMA latency"}
{"type":"thought","data":" example computes to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 0.8 seconds for ten"}
{"type":"thought","data":" million dependent DRAM"}
{"type":"thought","data":" loads at 80 nanoseconds."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nRemote NUMA latency is 1.6 seconds, twice the local 80 ns value. Bandwidth drops to 16 GB/s from 40 GB/s, or two-fifths of local throughput; these are illustrative numbers, not datasheet figures. NAPI’s 14.88 million packets per second limit is derived from a 64-byte frame plus 20 bytes of preamble and inter-frame gap, totaling 84 bytes."}
