08,101,32,115,101,114,118,105,99,101,115,32,110,111,116,101,10,49,53,53,99,98,98,98,57,32,100,111,99,115,40,97,111,115,41,58,32,119,114,105,116,101,32,116,104,101,32,71,77,83,32,112,97,112,101,114,32,110,111,116,101,10,35,35,32,97,111,115,47,119,114,105,116,101,114,45,112,97,114,116,45,48,45,49,10,97,111,115,47,119,114,105,116,101,114,45,112,97,114,116,45,48,45,49,10],"output_for_prompt":"exit: 0\n07e7a747 Merge aos/writer-part-5 (Grok crew, partial)\nedaeb81f Merge aos/writer-part-4 (Grok crew, partial)\nf39dafa1 Merge aos/writer-part-3 (Grok crew, partial)\n278d51a6 Merge aos/writer-part-2 (Grok crew, partial)\n2627011e Merge aos/writer-part-0-1 (Grok crew, partial)\n9d893f30 docs(aos): write the L05b Lamport clocks note\nd833a6f5 docs(aos): write the L09a giant-scale services note\n155cbbb9 docs(aos): write the GMS paper note\n## aos/writer-part-0-1\naos/writer-part-0-1\n","exit_code":0,"command":"git log -8 --oneline && git status -sb && git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD","truncated":false,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"description":"Check branch, status, and commit style","current_dir":"/Users/shreejitverma/.treehouse/SDE-Interview-Prep-3215ec/3/SDE-Interview-Prep","output_file":"/Users/shreejitverma/.grok/sessions/%2FUsers%2Fshreejitverma%2F.treehouse%2FSDE-Interview-Prep-3215ec%2F3%2FSDE-Interview-Prep/01a0f71a-f306-73c3-ab9a-51a13b9278b3/terminal/call-a87fb312-7ebe-4184-bf2c-ce9b8440bd45-27.log","total_bytes":476},"locations":[]}
{"type":"thought","data":"Commit messages will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" follow conventional"}
{"type":"thought","data":" commit formatting."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe R02 note will "}
{"type":"thought","data":"cover SMP versus NUMA,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file system data structures"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and inodes, block devices"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the file system,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and network protocol"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stack layers in Linux."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Exact heading strings"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and coverage tags from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the stub are being "}
{"type":"thought","data":"preserved verbatim."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA fifth section on"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the data path from "}
{"type":"thought","data":"application to NIC is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" being added. The file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be long. Horizontal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rules will be avoided"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to prevent markdown"}
{"type":"thought","data":" issues. Each list item"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and callout line will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contain exactly one"}
{"type":"thought","data":" full sentence."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nVerifying key networking"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and storage facts before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" writing. Confirmed "}
{"type":"thought","data":"10GbE minimum packet"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rate, TCP MSS, Ethernet"}
{"type":"thought","data":" frame sizes, and ext4"}
{"type":"thought","data":" superblock offset."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nConfirmed ext4 defaults:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 4096-byte blocks, 256-byte"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inodes, and 16384 bytes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" per inode. The block"}
{"type":"thought","data":" bitmap limit of 32768"}
{"type":"thought","data":" blocks per group is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verified for 4 KiB "}
{"type":"thought","data":"blocks. Inode numbering"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is 1-based, with inode"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 0 invalid."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nConfirmed ext2 reserved"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inodes: inode 1 is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the bad-blocks list,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2 is root, and 3 is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" user quota. The first"}
{"type":"thought","data":" non-reserved inode "}
{"type":"thought","data":"is 11. The formula for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" calculating block groups"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from inode numbers "}
{"type":"thought","data":"remains valid despite"}
{"type":"thought","data":" these reserved slots."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFor the NUMA section,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the note will cover"}
{"type":"thought","data":" MPOL_BIND, MPOL_PREFERRED,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" MPOL_INTERLEAVE, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" default first-touch"}
{"type":"thought","data":" behavior.\n\nThe default NUMA policy"}
{"type":"thought","data":" allocates anonymous"}
{"type":"thought","data":" memory on the faulting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" CPU's node. File-backed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pages follow the same"}
{"type":"thought","data":" first-touch rule, though"}
{"type":"thought","data":" shared file mappings"}
{"type":"thought","data":" can be touched by a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" different process. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"Automatic NUMA balancing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" periodically migrates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pages based on which"}
{"type":"thought","data":" node faults them."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe automatic NUMA"}
{"type":"thought","data":" balancing mechanism"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be identified "}
{"type":"thought","data":"by its sysctl `kernel.numa_balancing`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe fair class scheduler"}
{"type":"thought","data":" now uses EEVDF, replacing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" CFS in Linux 6.6. It"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still schedules within"}
{"type":"thought","data":" NUMA sched domains."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nVirtio 1.3 is verified."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The note will explain"}
{"type":"thought","data":" split and packed virtqueues"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as descriptor rings"}
{"type":"thought","data":" shared between device"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and driver, similar"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to NVMe or NIC rings,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with links to the spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and kernel docs.\n\nCXL"}
{"type":"thought","data":" memory devices are "}
{"type":"thought","data":"enumerated by the kernel"}
{"type":"thought","data":" CXL subsystem and can"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be onlined as memory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with a larger NUMA "}
{"type":"thought","data":"distance than local "}
{"type":"thought","data":"DRAM."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nXDP native mode runs"}
{"type":"thought","data":" before socket buffer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" allocation. Generic"}
{"type":"thought","data":" XDP operates on the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" existing socket buffer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" path. AF_XDP redirects"}
{"type":"thought","data":" traffic to user-space"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rings.\n\nio_uring_setup"}
{"type":"thought","data":" creates submission "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and completion queues."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nChecksum offload and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" segmentation offload"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are documented. TSO"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lets the network card"}
{"type":"thought","data":" split large TCP segments."}
{"type":"thought","data":" GSO performs software"}
{"type":"thought","data":" segmentation just before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the driver when the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" device cannot. GRO "}
{"type":"thought","data":"merges incoming packets"}
{"type":"thought","data":" during receive.\n\nRCU"}
{"type":"thought","data":" protects VFS dentry"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and routing lookups."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nRCU also protects "}
{"type":"thought","data":"path lookup and the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"forwarding table, so"}
{"type":"thought","data":" readers avoid per-packet"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or per-component locks."}
{"type":"thought","data":" MirageOS, IncludeOS,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and Unikraft are noted"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as library OS unikernels"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that embed the TCP "}
{"type":"thought","data":"stack and block driver"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the application "}
{"type":"thought","data":"address space. seL4 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"is confirmed as an L4-family"}
{"type":"thought","data":" microkernel with network"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and disk stacks running"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as user-level servers."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe seL4 microkernel"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be mentioned briefly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" without a URL, since"}
{"type":"thought","data":" no vault note exists"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for it. The Dynamo "}
{"type":"thought","data":"paper by DeCandia et"}
{"type":"thought","data":" al. (SOSP 2007) will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be linked, but its "}
{"type":"thought","data":"abstract will not be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" copied verbatim."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA Dynamo-style store"}
{"type":"thought","data":" keeps replicas on ordinary"}
{"type":"thought","data":" local file systems "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and communicates with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" peers over the same"}
{"type":"thought","data":" socket path described"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in this note.\n\nRaft"}
{"type":"thought","data":" consensus still logs"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to a local block device"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and replicates over"}
{"type":"thought","data":" TCP or a similar transport."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The Ongaro and Ousterhout"}
{"type":"thought","data":" paper will be named"}
{"type":"thought","data":" without a URL. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"official Raft PDF may"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be verified for inclusion"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in further reading."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nqspinlock is skipped"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because it falls outside"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the scope of this lesson."}
{"type":"thought","data":" KSM will be noted as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a descendant that does"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not alter the storage"}
{"type":"thought","data":" path."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe ephemeral port"}
{"type":"thought","data":" range on Linux is typically"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 32768–60999, though"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this default should"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be verified before "}
{"type":"thought","data":"being stated."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nSO_REUSEPORT allows"}
{"type":"thought","data":" multiple sockets to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" bind the same port,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with the kernel hashing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" each flow onto one "}
{"type":"thought","data":"listener. UDP demultiplexing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" uses the protocol, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"local IP, and local "}
{"type":"thought","data":"port, plus the remote"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pair when the socket"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is connected."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nTCP demultiplexing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" uses the full four-tuple,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so two connections "}
{"type":"thought","data":"can share a local port"}
{"type":"thought","data":" when their remote endpoints"}
{"type":"thought","data":" differ. The diagnostic"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test will include a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" table mapping each "}
{"type":"thought","data":"layer to its functionality."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe draft will be "}
{"type":"thought","data":"kept high quality but"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not endless, roughly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" matching the length"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of R01. Post-write "}
{"type":"thought","data":"checks will scan for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" non-ASCII characters,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" seed text, and em dashes,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" then run the coverage"}
{"type":"thought","data":" validator. A sentence-per-line"}
{"type":"thought","data":" heuristic will flag"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prose lines containing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" \". \" followed by a "}
{"type":"thought","data":"capital letter, since"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that likely indicates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" two sentences in one"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe note will include"}
{"type":"thought","data":" two folded practice"}
{"type":"thought","data":" questions using worked"}
{"type":"thought","data":" numbers, consistent"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with R01. The lab section"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will keep its existing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" link and add a sentence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" noting that the lab"}
{"type":"thought","data":" crew owns the commands."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nVerified URLs for "}
{"type":"thought","data":"further reading now "}
{"type":"thought","data":"include the NUMA performance"}
{"type":"thought","data":" guide, VFS documentation,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ext4 overview and inodes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pages, block layer "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and blk-mq documentation,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and socket(7) man page."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAdditional verified"}
{"type":"thought","data":" URLs for the further"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reading list include"}
