{"type":"thought","data":" addition."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe draft will be "}
{"type":"thought","data":"committed and reported"}
{"type":"thought","data":" next. Callout titles"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are not counted as "}
{"type":"thought","data":"sentences; only the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"following prose lines"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are. Self-check questions"}
