{"type":"thought","data":" Practice section. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" paper section will "}
{"type":"thought","data":"mirror R01’s structure,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and modern descendants"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be written as "}
{"type":"thought","data":"several paragraphs with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one sentence per line."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nEach concept will "}
{"type":"thought","data":"be at least four paragraphs."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Several factual errors"}
{"type":"thought","data":" were caught and corrected:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" SMP has private caches,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" NUMA is still shared"}
{"type":"thought","data":" memory with non-uniform"}
{"type":"thought","data":" access, the block layer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" does not understand"}
{"type":"thought","data":" filenames, TCP is layer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 4 without an OSI session"}
{"type":"thought","data":" layer, a port is 16"}
{"type":"thought","data":" bits, and the minimum"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Ethernet frame is 64"}
{"type":"thought","data":" bytes including header"}
