{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe worked examples"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will frame the latency"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and bandwidth figures"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as inputs rather than"}
{"type":"thought","data":" measured values. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 8 GB array will be "}
{"type":"thought","data":"written as 8 × 10^9 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"bytes so the arithmetic"}
{"type":"thought","data":" divides evenly."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe 8 GB example will"}
