{"type":"thought","data":" of latency. Migration"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pays off after roughly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" three scans."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe migration example"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will explicitly assume"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a 10 GB/s copy bandwidth"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and ignore fault overhead."}
