{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-908da7ae-8018-45f6-b447-aa182fc3f2da-38","title":"search_replace","kind":"edit","status":"pending","toolName":"search_replace","rawInput":{"file_path":"/Users/shreejitverma/.treehouse/SDE-Interview-Prep-3215ec/3/SDE-Interview-Prep/01-CS-Foundations/Operating-Systems/AOS/Part-0-Refresher/R02-Architecture-Storage-and-Networking.md","old_string":"The array is 8000000000 / 4096 = 1953125 pages of 4 KiB, because 4096 * 1953125 = 8000000000.\nFirst touch of every page on the wrong node is 1953125 remote faults before any of the scan math applies.","new_string":"The array is 8000000000 / 4096 = 1953125 pages of 4 KiB, because 4096 * 1953125 = 8000000000.\nFirst touch by a thread on the slow node allocates all 1953125 pages there.\nThe later bandwidth-bound scan does not fault those pages again.\nIt reads them remotely, which is the 0.5 second case.\nA migration has to copy the pages, or automatic NUMA balancing has to unmap them and catch a later fault, before the scan becomes local."},"content":[],"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-908da7ae-8018-45f6-b447-aa182fc3f2da-38","status":null,"content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/Users/shreejitverma/.treehouse/SDE-Interview-Prep-3215ec/3/SDE-Interview-Prep/01-CS-Foundations/Operating-Systems/AOS/Part-0-Refresher/R02-Architecture-Storage-and-Networking.md","oldText":"The array is 8000000000 / 4096 = 1953125 pages of 4 KiB, because 4096 * 1953125 = 8000000000.\nFirst touch of every page on the wrong node is 1953125 remote faults before any of the scan math applies.","newText":"The array is 8000000000 / 4096 = 1953125 pages of 4 KiB, because 4096 * 1953125 = 8000000000.\nFirst touch by a thread on the slow node allocates all 1953125 pages there.\nThe later bandwidth-bound scan does not fault those pages again.\nIt reads them remotely, which is the 0.5 second case.\nA migration has to copy the pages, or automatic NUMA balancing has to unmap them and catch a later fault, before the scan becomes local."}],"rawOutput":null,"locations":[{"path":"/Users/shreejitverma/.treehouse/SDE-Interview-Prep-3215ec/3/SDE-Interview-Prep/01-CS-Foundations/Operating-Systems/AOS/Part-0-Refresher/R02-Architecture-Storage-and-Networking.md"}]}
